# machine-local: the stock game binary (copyrighted, 11 MB) and personal game settings
backup/
# run logs and lldb scratch copies of the game binary
runs/
scratch/
.DS_Store

# built from tools/*.c (build line in each file header); not committed, same as cs2's driver. The one
# exception is the click helper, which an install needs and no player can build (tools/frame-fix.build)
tools/*.exe
!tools/frame-fix.exe

